rule link: the same link on wine's builtin msvcrt keeps the body where f0 was, at the start: two or three copies fold to the same place under either CRT, five do not (contrast)
link /entry:main /subsystem:console /nodefaultlib
link-crt builtin
map
  0001:00000000 ?f*
  0001:00000010 ?d0@@YAHH@Z *
  0001:00000020 ?d1@@YAHH@Z *
map
  0001:00000000 ?f0@@YAHH@Z *
map
  0001:00000000 ?f1@@YAHH@Z *
map
  0001:00000000 ?f2@@YAHH@Z *
map
  0001:00000000 ?f3@@YAHH@Z *
map
  0001:00000000 ?f4@@YAHH@Z *
